<BaseLayout title="Part IV · Density Functional Theory" description="How the interacting ground-state problem becomes a density variational theory, why Kohn–Sham orbitals are auxiliary, and where exchange-correlation approximations and self-consistency enter." current="core">
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
